css-checkbox-generator.formula:
.fancy-check input { position: absolute; opacity: 0; }   /* real input stays in DOM */
.fancy-check .box { width: S; height: S; border: W solid BC; border-radius: S × corner%; }
.fancy-check input:checked + .box { background: ACCENT; border-color: ACCENT; }
.fancy-check .box::after { /* checkmark */ border-width: 0 W W 0; transform: rotate(45deg); }

Switch: track width = 2 × S, knob = S − 4, travel = track − knob − 4

css-checkbox-generator.workedExample:
Settings: checkbox, size 20px, accent #4f46e5, border #94a3b8, border width 2px, corner roundness 25%.
Generated box CSS (excerpt):
.fancy-check .box {
  width: 20px;
  height: 20px;
  border: 2px solid #94a3b8;
  border-radius: 5px;   /* 20 × 25% = 5 */
}
.fancy-check input:checked + .box {
  background: #4f46e5;
  border-color: #4f46e5;
}
The checkmark inside scales automatically (5×9px at this size), and switching to Switch mode would produce a 40px-wide track with a 16px knob traveling 20px.
